<section id="message">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ceo rv"><figure class="pt"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="P Sukumaran, Joint Managing Director"></figure><div><blockquote>India is entering one of the most exciting phases of its economic journey. Behind every globally competitive manufacturing nation lies one common denominator: world-class infrastructure.</blockquote><cite>P Sukumaran<small>Joint Managing Director, Rinac India Limited</small></cite><p class="sg">The opportunities before India have never been greater. With innovation, engineering excellence and customer-centricity, Rinac will keep building the infrastructure that powers India’s next chapter of growth.</p></div></div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div><b data-n="350" data-s="M+">0</b><small>tonnes of horticultural produce a year</small></div>
      <div><b data-n="8800" data-s="+">0</b><small>cold storages across India</small></div>
      <div><b data-n="40" data-s="M MT">0</b><small>combined storage capacity</small></div>
    </div>
    <details class="more"><summary>Read the full message</summary>
      <p>Businesses need facilities that are built faster, run more efficiently and deliver long-term value, which is why clean modular construction is becoming the preferred way to build industrial infrastructure.</p>
      <p>This year we launched RINAC Mango Export Packhouse Infrastructure and FruitoLine HHAT/VHT Solutions: a turnkey ecosystem from pre-cooling and heat treatment to grading, packing, ripening and export-ready logistics.</p>
      <p>We also added R-Wool Stonewool Insulated Panels for data centres, semiconductor, battery and EV facilities, renewable energy, aerospace and defence. For over three decades, Rinac has built integrated cold chain, cleanroom and modular infrastructure with its customers.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

