    <h2>Where we’ve <em>been</em></h2>
    <div style="margin-top:70px">
      <details class="ev" open><summary><time>6 April 2026</time><h3>RINFRA celebration<small>Aalankrita Resorts, Hyderabad</small></h3></summary><p>Our after-sales service division marked 15 years of its South East Division with a day of team-building and appreciation for service excellence.</p></details>
